  "description": "Crestful is the core convention-first REST framework for ASP.NET Core. Define a resource once and receive a production-ready CRUD API: automatic resource discovery, generated Minimal API endpoints (GET, GET/{id}, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE), a thread-safe in-memory data source, before/after lifecycle hooks, custom endpoints, and standardized ProblemDetails errors — plain ASP.NET Core underneath.",
